              "type": "verse",
              "number": "1",
              "lines": [
                "Tazameni jambo la majabu (yo) jambo, la majabu wakamuza Yusufu neno la mungu wa uzima kwa wa Ismaeli."
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-46e04a2d",
              "type": "refrain",
              "lines": [
                "Kapiteni potifari wa inchi ya misri kamushika Yusufu , kamutupa gerezani ju ya muke wake alimunenea hivi tazama Yusufu ameningilia leo, Tazama kitani ni mikononi mwangu"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-1c8f3763",
              "type": "verse",
              "number": "2",
              "lines": [
                "Jehova mungu kamwambia Musa kiongozi ~2x ni taokowa israeli ju ya zambi zao ku mulima sinai katika mwezi wa kwanza mu mwaka wa pili katika mwezi wa kwanza."
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
